<title>GERMANY: German debt markets closed on Friday March 28.</title>
<headline>German debt markets closed on Friday March 28.</headline>
<text>
<p>German debt markets are closed on Friday March 28 for a public holiday. The markets will reopen on Tuesday April 1 at 0730 GMT.</p>
</text>
